              service.id === 'design' ?
                'Great design is more than aesthetics: it&apos;s about building intuitive experiences and motion that helps a brand move. Katlyn leads brand, UI, and motion design, from static interfaces to explainer animations and social/marketing motion that brings products to life.' :
              service.id === 'ai-integration' ? 
                'We add AI to your digital products in ways that actually help: automating processes, improving functionality, and giving users more relevant experiences. We focus on practical AI applications that produce real business value.' :
              service.id === 'app-development' ? 
                'Extend your reach with custom mobile applications that meet users on their preferred devices. Whether you need a native iOS/Android app or a cross-platform solution, we build mobile experiences users keep coming back to.' :
